Z||000015||Patrick||04-27-2000||03:58 AM||||<BR><B>batboy</B>, forgive me for intruding on your thread for the second time, but I haven't seen so much pussy-footin' around here since the last time you posted pictures of your cat! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Excuse me while I address some of the other fellas...<P>Look guys, if you have a problem with me personally or with what I say, feel free to use my name. You're not going to hurt my feelings (like you'd be worried about that) and at least everyone would know who the heck you're talking about.<P><B>fiero56</B>, I'm rather surprised at your attitude. You act like you're still pissed off at me about the hydraulic clutch problems you had ages ago. I thought we had cleared the air about that, but apparently I'm mistaken. In this thread I asked you an honest question, and all you can do is make some wisecrack. Make that <I>two</I> wisecracks. I noticed you deleted the first crack about it being interesting that I would be the one to respond to your original post in this thread. Hmmm....I used to have a lot more respect for you.<P><B>olympic</B>, sorry if you're getting caught in the crossfire, but here's the thread you were looking for -<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/000925.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/000925.html</A> <P>It might make good reading for anyone interested in the facts.<P><B>M-man</B>, if, and I mean IF it's me you're referring to (as I really don't know), all I can say is that I already informed you in the thread mentioned above that you were <I>not</I> the reason I started that particular thread. Honest.<P><B>batboy</B>, back to you. How about posting another picture of that huge cat of yours? We could use a change of pace around here. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
